---
// "#rep" ("Talk to us") — ported verbatim from reference/home.html's
// <section class="talk" id="rep" data-astro-cid-jow3qlqj>.
//
// IMPORTANT FINDING (see NOTES.md): there is NO contact form anywhere on the
// live homepage — no <form>, no <input type="email">/"tel">, nothing. The
// brief describes building "every field/label/placeholder/required flag" of
// a contact form, but the actual section is just eyebrow + heading + two
// lead paragraphs + three contact rows (Email/Visit/Call), each a plain
// link (mailto:/maps/tel:). Reproduced exactly — no form was invented.
---

<section class="talk" id="rep">
  <div class="shell grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow gold">Talk to us</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Tell us what<br />you're building.</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        At Stirling Flavors, our passion is creating fabulous flavors and our customers and
        partners challenge us to make better, bolder and more flavorful products. Always up for
        that challenge, you never know when Stirling creates something exclusive.
      </p>
      <p class="lead">Let us bring some of that passion to your coffee and customers. Contact us to become a Stirling aficionado.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="rows">
      <li>
        <a href="mailto:info@stirlingflavors.com">
          <span class="label">Email</span>
          <span class="value">info@stirlingflavors.com</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a
          href="https://maps.google.com/?q=19220%2064th%20Ave%20S%2C%20Kent%2C%20Washington%2098032"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          <span class="label">Visit</span>
          <span class="value">19220 64th Ave S, Kent, Washington 98032</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="tel:+12538676133">
          <span class="label">Call</span>
          <span class="value">253.867.6133</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .talk {
    background: var(--plum);
    color: #fff;
    padding-block: clamp(64px, 9vw, 132px);
  }
  .grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px);
    display: grid;
  }
  .gold {
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .lead {
    color: var(--on-dark);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .rows {
    border-radius: var(--r-md);
    gap: 1px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .rows a {
    background: var(--card-dark);
    transition: background var(--t-hover);
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 30px 32px;
    display: grid;
  }
  .rows a:hover {
    background: var(--card-dark-hover);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .label {
    letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .value {
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 24px);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
